        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, um, so about... well, about four days. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help.",
