      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:45",
      "end_timestamp": "00:55",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Honestly, every other day. A warm cloth helps a bit. Moderate, really. I've also had muffled hearing, since last weekend. And there's a runny nose before it started as well, about two weeks now. With runny nose before it started, I'd say moderate.",
